{"type":"text","timestamp":1790375145554,"sessionID":"ses_f2553ebd8ffepFy5PYvXjauNAn","part":{"id":"prt_0daacb02e001GBjHyCfZyk6Tz3","messageID":"msg_0daac70d4001b9TuGNW17dtRaS","sessionID":"ses_f2553ebd8ffepFy5PYvXjauNAn","type":"text","text":"The main scene already assigns units to `player_units` and `enemy_units`. I’ll use a base range of 32 pixels, so the player’s attack range of 2 detects the enemy at 50 pixels but excludes the one at 130 pixels. The target finder will wait for the actor’s ready signal so its `detect_range` reference is initialized before connecting.\n","time":{"start":1790375145518,"end":1790375145522},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"msg_0536e0f7a7541c92016ab6f4e6c1d48190b723a17dd768ba64","phase":"commentary"}}}}
